Description: panvk/jm: re-emit the fragment RSD when the input attachment map changes
 The renderer state reads the input attachment map to decide which render
 targets and depth/stencil are read by the shader. Replace the duplicated
 DS_DEPTH_COMPARE_OP check in the dirty list with INPUT_ATTACHMENT_MAP.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
index b0dc7c3427c..41d70ed8fc5 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
